WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.550
Crouching MK deliberately misses Ryu while he is down.

2
00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.400
Light-kick Scutum follows the timing whiff.

3
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.200
The Scutum throw catches the recorded Ryu.

4
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.950
The command throw leaves Ryu down in the corner.
